    {
      "path": "AGENTS.md",
      "text": "# Analyst workspace\n\nFor a new feature, use ai-coding/brief.md to capture requirements. Write an observable acceptance example and record open decisions. Hand the reviewed brief to design and development.\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai-coding/brief.md",
      "text": "# Feature brief\n\n## User and job\nWho needs this change, and what are they trying to do?\n\n## Acceptance examples\nDescribe a success, a failure and recovery.\n\n## Open decisions\nRecord the owner and the trade-off.\n\n## Handoff\nLink the reviewed design and name its next owner.\n"
    }
